---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Pricing | SplitVerde"><section class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-20"><h1 class="text-5xl font-bold text-emerald-950">Simple, affordable pricing.</h1><p class="mt-4 text-slate-600">Proposed pricing — subscriptions are not available yet.</p><div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2"><article class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-9 shadow-sm"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Basic</h2><p class="my-5 text-4xl font-bold">$9<span class="text-base font-normal">/month</span></p><p>For individual agents: imports, reconciliation, discrepancies, and reporting.</p></article><article class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-9 shadow-sm"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Premier</h2><p class="my-5 text-4xl font-bold">$19<span class="text-base font-normal">/month</span></p><p>Everything in Basic plus producer compensation and agency reporting.</p></article></div></section></Base>